@startuml agentd-vs-openclaw-scaffold
' ============================================================================
'  agentd (ours) vs OpenClaw — the agent scaffold, layer by layer.
'  green = HARD (enforced by code / automatic, model cannot skip)
'  amber = THIN / partial / optional
'  red   = BRITTLE (observed being skipped -> silent gap)
'  Render: java -jar ../../../plantuml.jar -charset UTF-8 -tpng agentd-vs-openclaw-scaffold.puml
' ============================================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 10
skinparam ranksep 14
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #888888
  roundCorner 6
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

title Agent scaffold, layer by layer - agentd (ours) vs OpenClaw\ngreen = HARD (code-enforced / automatic)   amber = thin / optional   red = BRITTLE (model skips it -> silent gap)

' ----- column headers -----
rectangle "LAYER" as L0 #CFD8DC
rectangle "AGENTD  (ours)" as A0 #B0BEC5
rectangle "OPENCLAW  (reference)" as B0 #B0BEC5

' ----- LAYER labels (left column) -----
rectangle "1 · Triggers" as L1 #ECEFF1
rectangle "2 · Prompt\nassembly" as L2 #ECEFF1
rectangle "3 · Engine /\nloop" as L3 #ECEFF1
rectangle "4 · TOOL seam\n(pre/post tool)" as L4 #ECEFF1
rectangle "5 · TURN seam\n(memory)" as L5 #ECEFF1
rectangle "6 · RUN seam\n(outcome)" as L6 #ECEFF1
rectangle "7 · Memory +\nknowledge" as L7 #ECEFF1
rectangle "8 · Skills /\nself-improve" as L8 #ECEFF1
rectangle "9 · Workspace /\nexec / sandbox" as L9 #ECEFF1

' ----- AGENTD column -----
rectangle "chat · email channel · cron / heartbeat" as A1 #C8E6C9
rectangle "SOUL · IDENTITY · skills (advertised)\nhonesty = prompt nudge (SOFT)" as A2 #C8E6C9
rectangle "native loop · model failover · idle/req timeout" as A3 #C8E6C9
rectangle "**GuardedTool**: timeout + retry + error-norm\n= HARD.   policy / approval = deferred" as A4 #C8E6C9
rectangle "ContextPolicy compaction ONLY.\nno auto-inject · no auto-capture.\nmemory = optional tool  ->  0 rows written" as A5 #FFCDD2
rectangle "report_outcome = OPTIONAL  ->  run logged\nok with outcome=None.  Cannot tell a real\nsuccess from a silent failure." as A6 #FFCDD2
rectangle "Sqlite FTS5 + LIKE (keyword only).\nconsolidate = dedup.\nNO embeddings · NO dreaming" as A7 #FFE0B2
rectangle "skill_workshop create / update.\nNO autocapture (no learning loop)" as A8 #FFE0B2
rectangle "per-agent workspace (new).\nexec NOT OS-aware (-p folder bug).\nLocalSandbox seam only" as A9 #FFE0B2

' ----- OPENCLAW column -----
rectangle "chat · Slack/WhatsApp/Telegram/Discord/… · cron / heartbeat" as B1 #C8E6C9
rectangle "SOUL · AGENTS · skills (XML + version hash)\nhonesty" as B2 #C8E6C9
rectangle "harness loop wrapping the Codex app-server" as B3 #C8E6C9
rectangle "**native-hook-relay** pre/post tool  ->\npolicy + approval + loop-detect = HARD" as B4 #C8E6C9
rectangle "active-memory auto-INJECT every turn\n+ lancedb auto-CAPTURE = HARD (a hook, not a choice)" as B5 #C8E6C9
rectangle "session-end HOOKS: outcome handling +\nskill autocapture + memory ingestion = HARD" as B6 #C8E6C9
rectangle "sqlite-vec EMBEDDINGS + FTS5 hybrid\n+ DREAMING (3-phase scored promotion) + wiki" as B7 #C8E6C9
rectangle "skill_workshop + AUTOCAPTURE: scans the\ntranscript for corrections  ->  proposes a skill" as B8 #C8E6C9
rectangle "persistent workspace + docker / ssh sandbox" as B9 #C8E6C9

' ----- vertical stacks -----
L0 -[hidden]d- L1
L1 -[hidden]d- L2
L2 -[hidden]d- L3
L3 -[hidden]d- L4
L4 -[hidden]d- L5
L5 -[hidden]d- L6
L6 -[hidden]d- L7
L7 -[hidden]d- L8
L8 -[hidden]d- L9

A0 -[hidden]d- A1
A1 -[hidden]d- A2
A2 -[hidden]d- A3
A3 -[hidden]d- A4
A4 -[hidden]d- A5
A5 -[hidden]d- A6
A6 -[hidden]d- A7
A7 -[hidden]d- A8
A8 -[hidden]d- A9

B0 -[hidden]d- B1
B1 -[hidden]d- B2
B2 -[hidden]d- B3
B3 -[hidden]d- B4
B4 -[hidden]d- B5
B5 -[hidden]d- B6
B6 -[hidden]d- B7
B7 -[hidden]d- B8
B8 -[hidden]d- B9

' ----- column order (left to right) -----
L0 -[hidden]r- A0
A0 -[hidden]r- B0

legend bottom
  Read DOWN the agentd column: it is solid green through the TOOL seam (GuardedTool is real,
  code-enforced) - then turns RED at the TURN and RUN seams. That is the brittleness: memory and
  outcome are OPTIONAL tool calls the model skips, so memory stays at 0 rows and every cron run is
  logged "ok" with no proof it worked. OpenClaw makes those same seams HARD (hooks, not requests),
  so they cannot be skipped. The fix is not more prompting - it is code at the TURN and RUN seams.
endlegend

@enduml
